%description:
Tests PAWS (RFC 7323 section 5.3, R1). The tester delays the first ACK of the
server by 1 s, so that the ACK of the second data segment (TSval 1702) arrives
first and sets TS.Recent. The delayed ACK (TSval 1202 < TS.Recent) is not
acceptable: the client drops it and sends an ACK in reply. Master dropped a
segment only after 24 days of idle time.

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

*.cli_app.sendScript="1.0 100; 1.5 100"
*.*_tcp.timestampSupport = true
*.cli_tcp.nagleEnabled = false
*.tcptester.script="B2 delay 1"

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[1.001 A003] A.1000 > B.2000: A 1:101(100) ack 501 win 16384   Option(s): NOP NOP TS(1000,2)
[1.203 B002] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 101 win 16384   Option(s): NOP NOP TS(1202,1000)# removing original
[1.501 A004] A.1000 > B.2000: A 101:201(100) ack 501 win 16384   Option(s): NOP NOP TS(1500,2)
[1.703 B003] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 201 win 16384   Option(s): NOP NOP TS(1702,1500)
[2.203 B003] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 101 win 16384   Option(s): NOP NOP TS(1202,1000)# introducing copy
[2.205 A005] A.1000 > B.2000: A ack 501 win 16384   Option(s): NOP NOP TS(2204,1702)
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
PAWS: Segment is not acceptable, TSval=1202 < TS.Recent=1702 in ESTABLISHED state received: dropping segment
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
